-- ===== G. 33B =====
-- G1 courier + PP certificate: may life+15 strokes
#ASSERT `the sentence where the sixth column punishment is death` (`Section 33B Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS `The court may impose imprisonment for life and not fewer than 15 strokes of the cane instead (section 33B(1)(a))`
-- G2 courier, no certificate: death stands
#ASSERT `the sentence where the sixth column punishment is death` (`Section 33B Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS `The sentence of death stands`
-- G3 not courier, certificate: death stands
#ASSERT `the sentence where the sixth column punishment is death` (`Section 33B Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS `The sentence of death stands`
-- G4 courier + abnormality: must life
#ASSERT `the sentence where the sixth column punishment is death` (`Section 33B Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE) EQUALS `The court must impose imprisonment for life instead (section 33B(1)(b))`
-- G4b abnormality but not courier: death stands
#ASSERT `the sentence where the sixth column punishment is death` (`Section 33B Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE) EQUALS `The sentence of death stands`
-- G4c both gateways: (b) mandatory prevails
#ASSERT `the sentence where the sixth column punishment is death` (`Section 33B Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS `The court must impose imprisonment for life instead (section 33B(1)(b))`

